# Gitignored files that worktrees need, in gitignore syntax.
# Nothing to copy: dependencies are the Setup command's job, .scratch holds
# plans the lane reaches by absolute path, and .claude/{skills,agents} are
# dogfooding links a lane has no use for.

# MUST stay last — gitignore matching is last-match-wins, so only the final
# position reliably stops copy mechanisms cloning existing worktrees into a new one.
!.claude/worktrees/**
